      <title>谷歌逃过广告业务拆分 法官要求调整运营利好竞争对手</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260902/%E8%B0%B7%E6%AD%8C%E9%80%83%E8%BF%87%E5%B9%BF%E5%91%8A%E4%B8%9A%E5%8A%A1%E6%8B%86%E5%88%86-%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%98%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E8%B0%83%E6%95%B4%E8%BF%90%E8%90%A5%E5%88%A9%E5%A5%BD%E7%AB%9E%E4%BA%89%E5%AF%B9%E6%89%8B/</link>
